=== R11-01 HAPPY PATH (retry 3, fresh consumer groups), 21:02:30 ===
real bug #2 found: after deleting+recreating the Kafka topic, the consumer group's OLD
committed offset survived and pointed past the only message in the fresh topic, so
auto_offset_reset=earliest never applied (it only applies when NO committed offset exists).
kafka-consumer-groups.sh --delete got stuck (GroupNotEmptyException, stuck coordinator state)
even after stopping the consumers. Fixed pragmatically (a real, defensible operational technique):
switched to fresh consumer-group IDs (order-service-v2, payment-service-v2).
